[02:07.252]May we smile all day and all night
{"愿我们日夜展露笑颜"}
[02:09.088]Nurture love with all your might
{"用尽全力培育爱恋"}
[02:10.884]Tomorrow we will reach a new height
{"明日我们将攀越新巅"}
[02:14.608]On the world's stage, take your flight
{"在世界舞台翱翔翩跹"}
[02:16.460]We'll climb up high and seize the light
{"攀登高处紧握光芒"}
[02:18.105]Year by year, talents ignite
{"年复一年才华绽放"}
[02:21.362]Swing left, swing right
{"左摇右摆舞步翩然"}
[02:24.933]When you laugh, the star will shine
{"当你欢笑星辰璀璨"}
[02:29.094]Shout it loud and feel the pride
{"放声呐喊自豪满腔"}
[02:32.850]I Wish you great wealth, hooray
{"祝你财源滚滚　欢呼吧"}
